# Allowlist for scripts/check_substrate_stubs.sh.
#
# Format:
#   <MarkerName-or-consideration-string> <ticket-id>     # Audit 1 / 2
#   STUB:<file>:<line>:<dse_name>        <ticket-id>     # Audit 3 — plan-template stub
#
# Comments: everything after `#` is ignored.
#
# Each entry MUST cite the ticket that wires the marker (Audit 1),
# fixes the consideration reference (Audit 2), or lands the named
# successor entity for a plan-template stub (Audit 3). When the work
# lands, drop the entry; the lint will then enforce that the substrate
# stays wired. Adding a new entry without a ticket id is a code-review
# failure.
#
# Catalogue: docs/open-work/pre-existing/substrate-stub-catalogue.md

STUB:src/ai/planner/actions.rs:729:trashing 200    # Trashing routes through Wilds until PlannerZone::Midden lands (ticket 200) — line shifted by 035's burying_actions() insertion + 364's htn_primitive_actions() insertion + late-364 travel_actions splice + 235's picking_up_actions DepositHerbs-prefix insertion + 367's drying/smoking/tend_smoking_rack actions insertion + 367-follow-on's drying_food_actions DropItem/RetrieveDryable prefix extension + 443's smoking_meat_actions multi-step expansion + 450's begging_actions() insertion + cargo-fmt reflow + 457's crafting_actions() insertion + 369's crafting_actions() expansion to include CraftAtTanningFrame + 463's craft_have_item_actions() insertion + 463 commit 8 belt-and-braces (Option<RecipeId> + restored crafting_actions) + 334's htn_primitive_actions() WearItem early-return arm + 468's crafting_actions() retire (legacy template deleted; HaveItem path is the sole Crafting entry) + 140-step-10's fleeing_actions FledThisPlan doc/leg expansion

